# M8x20 fasteners carry a misprinted label; if the (preference)

Standing user preference: M8x20 fasteners carry a misprinted label; if the sketch requires 25 mm, verify the actual fastener length with a ruler before use.

## Conventions
- M8x20 fasteners carry a misprinted label; if the sketch requires 25 mm, verify the actual fastener length with a ruler before use.

